{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12150","headline":"秋夜作 · 钱起","name":"秋夜作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万计各无成，寸心日悠漫。\n浮生竟何穷，巧历不能算。\n流落四海间，辛勤百年半。\n商歌向秋月，哀韵兼浩叹。\n寤寐怨佳期，美人隔霄汉。\n寒云度穷水，别业遶垂幔。\n窗中问谈鸡，长夜何时旦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}